      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BETTERTHAN SECRET (1) was once again right in the mix last start when runner-up over 2180m at Wagin, beaten 3.5 metres. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Steps up a level but she is up to the task. HALFMOONBAY (3) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 7 metres from the winner in fourth over 2185m at this track. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a similar line up and he can figure in the finish. AUTUMN LADY NZ (4) is a genuine type who was a solid fifth most recently at this track. Among the better chances in what looks a suitable assignment. TRUE GRIT NZ (2) is in the mix if he can recapture the form from two starts back that saw him finish third over 2130m at Gloucester Park.",
